  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a grill or grill pan to medium-high heat.",
    "Grill the chicken breast for 5-6 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "In a blender or food processor, combine galangal, fish sauce, lime juice, salt, and black pepper, and blend until smooth.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the grilled chicken, confit tomato, and galangal sauce, and toss to combine.",
    "Soak the corn husk wraps in water for 30 seconds to make them pliable.",
    "Assemble the wraps by spooning the chicken and tomato mixture onto the center of each wrap.",
    "Top with chopped cilantro and serve immediately.",
    "Serve with additional lime wedges and fish sauce on the side, if desired."
  ],
